# Must never be served as a static file — it would be reachable at the
# clean URL /purchase-success ahead of the vercel.json rewrite to the gated
# api/purchase-success-page.js function, bypassing the entitlement check.
# The function reads its own copy from templates/purchase-success.html
# instead (still kept here for the still-live Cloudflare Worker, which
# serves it as a Workers Static Asset the same way it always has).
public/purchase-success.html
